    "created_at": "2025-04-30T06:22:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-30T06:22:16Z",
    "body": "An end-user-facing dialog needs to be attributable to a specific authority, so I do think we want something like a `Window` or `Document` object here.\r\n\r\n(Having said that, it's not clear to me that others are using request's window correctly. At least a couple of those cases I skimmed through should probably use the client instead.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
